  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『净小兽』车载空气净化器</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e954162e42514a53b0562fe85a596296.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-885cf1aff9de4ab7bf842d86059618f7-0-0dada6fa0eeed4232fcfe9890d754f535e66fa6ebaf80e4bca21beb8d6e0d5f5\" alt=\"IMG_20260527_114835.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 430.00px;height: 593.22px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 车载空气净化器</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">净小兽车载空气净化器，如图1-1，通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”。用户通过车机大屏或车内语音助手，实现对车载空气净化器的开启、关闭等功能。同时支持各类场景自动化功能，例如“早上通勤”。</span></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/b91edaeb55164a34a376745c2e689065.png?auth_key=1795677429-843e99f8898344d6b31c7d393f85e8b7-0-3498f0090d0f37a6f210d2bcb4e560fb3196a38fcbbf589dab5b63e9fb53b693\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a3df0de36f6f425c9d10083388315336.mp4?auth_key=1795677429-b074b5cc4d98487f94fbe156f0af3b7c-0-a6b81c862899bbda890a64c7b8e613af5bc0acf094831fa92a0afbd55f64c879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">视频 1-1 车载空气净化器车机联动</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏支持的空气净化器功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">开启</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车载空气净化器</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">关闭</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车载空气净化器</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> 电池低电量时显示：电池电量低于20%，请及时充电；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a568bc502fdc4e8380d6145f4273c57f.png?auth_key=1795677429-8e9b62b3dfb04644944cfcffa8aaba45-0-4d032daf97a2c6363967287369deded24e51aed44c65df825fdbd5a869da1c6b\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-2 智慧物联App-车载空气净化器设备详情</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 车机语音控制</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音控制车载空气净化器的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">打开车载空气净化器；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">关闭车载空气净化器；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/6e996c5c5d224be6a3bf7a0410ee04ea.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-da80e480b25f440e9a61f3190e367cff-0-1171147a977e9690eab3c409f0d7d0cb2c0c2b8a721a9a93ed5e495d67351151\" alt=\"IMG_20260527_114859.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 552.00px;height: 837.70px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 2-1 语音控制</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. 场景自动化功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端智慧物联App中，用户可以在“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">智慧物联APP-&gt;场景</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">”多个场景分类中，根据需要添加车载空气净化器的功能，如开启等离子净化功能。具体以如下场景模式为例：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">早上通勤；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5e61421a615e4306bfe6e2958090142e.png?auth_key=1795677429-3facb9db27ee4937bfc70a12933c8b61-0-294fe7a13467c38cac1053e2881b707e0247897a5e2fe671ca45592af69786f5\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 809.00px;height: 455.05px;\"></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 3-1 场景自动化--打开车载空气净化器</span></p>"
}
